</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">Instruction tuning for large language models: A survey.

</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock"><em id="bib.bib46.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">arXiv preprint arXiv:2308.10792</em>, 2023.

</span></li>
      
<li id="bib.bib47" class="ltx_bibitem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_role_refnum ltx_tag_bibitem">Zheng et al. (2024)</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock">
Kaiwen Zheng, Yongxin Chen, Hanzi Mao, Ming-Yu Liu, Jun Zhu, and Qinsheng Zhang.

