</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 13.78)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:36.62em;--ltx-fo-height:1.89em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="26.21" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 26.21)" width="506.72"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A5.F17.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:36.62em;">
<span id="A5.F17.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.F17.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Problem:
Find the positive base <math id="A5.F17.pic1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="b" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">b</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">b</annotation></semantics></math> in which the equation <math id="A5.F17.pic1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="5\cdot 25_{b}=137_{b}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">5</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0.222em" mathcolor="#000000" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msub><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">25</mn><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">b</mi></msub></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><msub><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">137</mn><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">b</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">5\cdot 25_{b}=137_{b}</annotation></semantics></math> is valid.</span></span>
<span id="A5.F17.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.F17.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Solution:</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A5.F17.pic2" class="ltx_picture ltx_figure_panel" height="246.69" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 550 246.69" width="550"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,246.69) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#818181;" fill="#818181" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 5.91 L 0 240.78 C 0 244.04 2.64 246.69 5.91 246.69 L 544.09 246.69 C 547.36 246.69 550 244.04 550 240.78 L 550 5.91 C 550 2.64 547.36 0 544.09 0 L 5.91 0 C 2.64 0 0 2.64 0 5.91 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 5.91 L 1.97 222.58 L 548.03 222.58 L 548.03 5.91 C 548.03 3.73 546.27 1.97 544.09 1.97 L 5.91 1.97 C 3.73 1.97 1.97 3.73 1.97 5.91 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#FF8080;--ltx-fill-color:#FF8080;--ltx-fg-color:#FF8080;" color="#FF8080" fill="#FF8080" fill-opacity="1.0" stroke="#FF8080"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 224.55 L 1.97 240.78 C 1.97 242.96 3.73 244.72 5.91 244.72 L 544.09 244.72 C 546.27 244.72 548.03 242.96 548.03 240.78 L 548.03 224.55 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 231.17)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:36.62em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="506.72"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A5.F17.pic2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:36.62em;">
<span id="A5.F17.pic2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.F17.pic2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Answer: Max length 1024 + Rainbow Padding</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 16.85)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:36.62em;--ltx-fo-height:14.01em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.22em;font-size:10pt;" height="196.99" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 193.91)" width="506.72"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A5.F17.pic2.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:36.62em;">
<span id="A5.F17.pic2.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.F17.pic2.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Write <math id="A5.F17.pic2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="25_{b}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">25</mn><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">b</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">25_{b}</annotation></semantics></math> in base <math id="A5.F17.pic2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="b" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">b</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">b</annotation></semantics></math> as <math id="A5.F17.pic2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="2b+5" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">b</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2b+5</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A5.F17.pic2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="137_{b}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">137</mn><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">b</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">137_{b}</annotation></semantics></math> in base <math id="A5.F17.pic2.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="b" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">b</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">b</annotation></semantics></math> as <math id="A5.F17.pic2.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="b^{2}+3b+7" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">b</mi><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn></msup><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">3</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">b</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">7</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">b^{2}+3b+7</annotation></semantics></math>. Then the equation becomes</span></span>
<span id="A5.Ex10" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A5.Ex10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="5(2b+5)=b^{2}+3b+7." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">5</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">b</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">5</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><msup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">b</mi><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn></msup><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">3</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">b</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">7</mn></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0em" mathcolor="#000000">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">5(2b+5)=b^{2}+3b+7.</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A5.F17.pic2.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.F17.pic2.2.2.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Expanding both sides gives</span></span>
<span id="A5.Ex11" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A5.Ex11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="10b+25=b^{2}+3b+7." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">10</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">b</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">25</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><msup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">b</mi><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn></msup><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">3</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">b</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">7</mn></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0em" mathcolor="#000000">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">10b+25=b^{2}+3b+7.</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A5.F17.pic2.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.F17.pic2.2.3.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Rearranging gives</span></span>
<span id="A5.Ex12" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A5.Ex12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="b^{2}-7b-18=0." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><msup><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">b</mi><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn></msup><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">7</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">b</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">18</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0em" mathcolor="#000000">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">b^{2}-7b-18=0.</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A5.F17.pic2.2.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.F17.pic2.2.4.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Factoring gives</span></span>
<span id="A5.Ex13" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A5.Ex13.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(b-9)(b+2)=0." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">b</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">9</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">b</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">+</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">0</mn></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" lspace="0em" mathcolor="#000000">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(b-9)(b+2)=0.</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A5.F17.pic2.2.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.F17.pic2.2.5.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Thus, <math id="A5.F17.pic2.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="b=9" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">b</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">b=9</annotation></semantics></math> or <math id="A5.F17.pic2.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="b=-2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">b</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">2</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">b=-2</annotation></semantics></math>. Since <math id="A5.F17.pic2.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="b" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">b</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">b</annotation></semantics></math> must be positive, the answer is <math id="A5.F17.pic2.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="b=\boxed{9}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">b</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">=</mo><menclose notation="box"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">9</mn></menclose></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">b=\boxed{9}</annotation></semantics></math>.
Final Answer: The final answer is <math id="A5.F17.pic2.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="9" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">9</mn><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">9</annotation></semantics></math>. I hope it is correct.
<span id="A5.F17.pic2.2.5.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&lt;eos&gt;&lt;pad<sub id="A5.F17.pic2.2.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_sub">0</sub>&gt;&lt;pad<sub id="A5.F17.pic2.2.5.1.1.2" class="ltx_sub">1</sub>&gt;&lt;pad<sub id="A5.F17.pic2.2.5.1.1.3" class="ltx_sub">2</sub>&gt;&lt;pad<sub id="A5.F17.pic2.2.5.1.1.4" class="ltx_sub">3</sub>&gt;</span>…</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A5.F17.pic3" class="ltx_picture ltx_figure_panel" height="62.15" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 550 62.15" width="550"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,62.15) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#818181;" fill="#818181" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 5.91 L 0 56.25 C 0 59.51 2.64 62.15 5.91 62.15 L 544.09 62.15 C 547.36 62.15 550 59.51 550 56.25 L 550 5.91 C 550 2.64 547.36 0 544.09 0 L 5.91 0 C 2.64 0 0 2.64 0 5.91 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 5.91 L 1.97 38.04 L 548.03 38.04 L 548.03 5.91 C 548.03 3.73 546.27 1.97 544.09 1.97 L 5.91 1.97 C 3.73 1.97 1.97 3.73 1.97 5.91 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 46.64)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:36.62em;--ltx-fo-height:0.69em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="506.72"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A5.F17.pic3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:36.62em;">
<span id="A5.F17.pic3.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.F17.pic3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#FFFFFF;">Answer: Max length 1024 + EOS padding</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 16.55)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:36.62em;--ltx-fo-height:0.7em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.2em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.45" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.69)" width="506.72"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A5.F17.pic3.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:36.62em;">
<span id="A5.F17.pic3.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.F17.pic3.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">&lt;eos&gt;&lt;eos&gt;&lt;eos&gt;&lt;eos&gt;&lt;eos&gt;<span id="A5.F17.pic3.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_serif">…</span></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 17: </span>LLaDA-base fine-tuned with Rainbow Padding, MATH with 3-shot examples. The model generate complete and correct answer, while below(tuned with <span id="A5.F17.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&lt;eos&gt;</span> padding) does not generate content at all.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A5.F18" class="ltx_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A5.F18.pic1" class="ltx_picture ltx_figure_panel" height="111.66" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 550 111.66" width="550"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,111.66) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#818181;" fill="#818181" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 5.91 L 0 105.75 C 0 109.02 2.64 111.66 5.91 111.66 L 544.09 111.66 C 547.36 111.66 550 109.02 550 105.75 L 550 5.91 C 550 2.64 547.36 0 544.09 0 L 5.91 0 C 2.64 0 0 2.64 0 5.91 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#FFFFFF;" fill="#FFFFFF" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 1.97 5.91 L 1.97 87.7 L 548.03 87.7 L 548.03 5.91 C 548.03 3.73 546.27 1.97 544.09 1.97 L 5.91 1.97 C 3.73 1.97 1.97 3.73 1.97 5.91 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 21.65 96.3)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:36.62em;--ltx-fo-height:0.68em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:10pt;" height="12.15" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.46)" width="506.72"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
