<span id="A5.F18.pic3.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A5.F18.pic3.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">&lt;eos&gt;&lt;eos&gt;&lt;eos&gt;&lt;eos&gt;&lt;eos&gt;<span id="A5.F18.pic3.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_serif">…</span></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 18: </span>Dream-base fine-tuned with Rainbow Padding, MATH with 3-shot examples. The model generate complete and correct answer, in contrast to below(tuned with <span id="A5.F18.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">&lt;eos&gt;</span> padding).</figcaption>
